<div style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; padding: 32px; border-radius: 16px;">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
    <h1 style="color: #6366f1; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0;"><%= @tenant.name %></h1>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 4px;">Confirmação de Agendamento</p>
  </div>

  <div style="background-color: #1e293b; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; border: 1px solid #334155;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px;">Olá, <%= @client.name %>! 👋</h2>
    <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px;">
      Seu agendamento foi confirmado com sucesso. Abaixo estão os detalhes do seu atendimento:
    </p>

    <table style="width: 100%; font-size: 14px; color: #e2e8f0; border-collapse: collapse;">
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #94a3b8;">Serviço:</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @service.name %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #94a3b8;">Profissional:</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @professional.name %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #94a3b8;">Data:</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @appointment.starts_at.strftime('%d/%m/%Y (%A)') %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #94a3b8;">Horário:</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right; color: #818cf8;"><%= @appointment.formatted_time %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #94a3b8;">Valor:</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right; color: #34d399;"><%= @service.formatted_price %></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5;">
    <p>Caso precise cancelar ou reagendar, favor entrar em contato ou acessar o link de autoatendimento.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 16px;">© <%= Time.current.year %> <%= @tenant.name %> • Desenvolvido com Agenda AI</p>
  </div>
</div>
